  "bodyHash": "398a964bc407cc8d",
  "content": "<p><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>元素爬行者：重製版</strong>是源自<a href=\"https://www.minecraftforum.net/forums/mapping-and-modding-java-edition/minecraft-mods/1275396-1-5-1-elemental-creepers-v3-2-1-daawwwwwww\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">xSmallDeadGuyx的原版模组</a>的移植版本，為了現代化此版本而添加了一些自由度。</span></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://i.imgur.com/r4SYiYl.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1428\" height=\"836\">&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\">功能：</span></span></strong></span></p>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">世界將 spawn 出 10 多種具有不同效果的爬行者；</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">可配置的 spawn 率、爆炸半徑以及個別控制爬行者的 spawn；</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">元素 TNT！殺死任何爬行者時，你有機會獲得該元素的黑粉，可以用來製作 TNT 或還原為原版黑粉。</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px\"><strong>爬行者列表：</strong></span><br></span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>水行者：</strong>Spawn於海洋及其他水上相關生物群系。爆炸後會形成一座水柱噴泉。<br><br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>火行者：</strong>Spawn於炎熱的地表生物群系，例如沙漠、高原和草原。近距離散布火焰。<br><br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>土行者：</strong>在爆炸處製造一堆泥土。注意不要在你家附近觸發它！</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>空氣行者：</strong>Spawn於山脈。把你彈到空中，記得帶一個水桶來防止墜落傷害！<br></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>電行者：</strong>Spawn時會召喚一道閃電，並使附近的爬行者觸發電荷；</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><br><strong>光行者：</strong>創造螢石並賦予你螢光效果；<br><strong>暗行者：</strong>破壞大部分有光照的區塊並賦予你失明效果；<br><br></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>冰行者：</strong>Spawn於寒冷生物群系。經過時會留下一條雪泥軌跡，爆炸時會形成大片雪堆，並使你移動速度減慢。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"border:unset;display:unset;float:unset;text-transform:unset;text-indent:unset;text-align:unset;width:unset;text-decoration:unset\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fimgur.com%252fxMWT7U\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://imgur.com/xMWT7U</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>熔岩行者：</strong>僅限地獄生物群系，爆炸後會形成一座熔岩噴泉。經過時會留下火焰軌跡。</span></p>\n<p><strong>&nbsp;<br></strong></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>氫氣行者：</strong>爆炸像普通的一樣威力十倍小心激怒這名爆炸狂魔！</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>逆向行者：</strong>把地面翻轉過來。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>礦工行者：</strong>幫你採掘附近的石頭及其變種。<br></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>幻象行者：</strong>創造出自身的四個複製品。真正的行者會爆炸，而其他四者嘗試騙過你。</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>煙火行者：</strong>Spawn煙花:D...但不要靠近它的爆炸區域！</span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>餅乾行者：</strong>爆炸不會造成任何傷害或破壞方塊，掉出2-4個餅乾。<br><br><strong>彩虹行者：</strong>極度稀有，隨機發動前述任意種行者的效果。</span></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;<span style=\"text-decoration:underline;font-size:18px\"><strong><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif\"><br>常見問題</span></strong></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">你是否有得到原作者允許進行此模制的製作?</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>A:</strong> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fi.imgur.com%252fcD4Mo1v.png\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">是的，我已經獲得授權。</a></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\">是否已支援 forge / 後置至 <em>[舊版本]</em>？</span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:14px\"><strong>A:</strong> <span style=\"font-size:8px\">否</span></span></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight:400;font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;font-size:18px\">若發現任何錯誤，請向 <a href=\"https://github.com/Luligabi1/ElementalCreepersRefabricated\" rel=\"nofollow\">GitHub 存放庫</a> 或 Discord 社群回報問題：<br></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fG4PjhEf\" rel=\"nofollow\"> <img src=\"https://discordapp.com/api/guilds/707435077679841350/embed.png?style=banner2&v=2\" alt=\"\" width=\"320\" height=\"76\"> </a></p>",
